5. implementation summary
================================================================
- command/code: commandTexts on the full string (any length). Split on |, &&, ;, newline.
- isUsable (length<=120, secret-like drop) applies to extracted tokens, not the whole argument.
- secret-bearing segments are skipped so flag-like and secret tokens never appear (keeps "filters export secret command" === []).
- quoted path chunks inside JS/eval tokens are expanded via pathWords (memorian-trigger.ts / memorian).
- summary: whole string when isUsable, plus pathWords of path-like words.
- PATH_KEYS, ARRAY_KEYS, MAX_TOKENS=32, ToolArgWindow unchanged.
- no other keys read.
